<td class="align-left" rowspan="1">–</td>
<td class="align-left" rowspan="1">–</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

</div>
                                                        <div class="text-heading">
              <div class="sticker sticker-header"></div>
        <h2 id="calendar-of-trading-days"  data-intoc   class="">Calendar of trading days</h2>
    </div>

            
            
            
            

<div class="text_content">
  <p>In 2026, the regulated market “Luxembourg Stock Exchange”, operated by the Bourse de Luxembourg, is open from Monday to Friday from 9 am to 5.40 pm CET, except for the following holidays:</p>
<p><a href="https://www.luxse.com/trading/opening-hours-and-closing-days">https://www.luxse.com/trading/opening-hours-and-closing-days</a></p>
<table style="width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td width="220"></td>
<td width="200"></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="220">Thursday, 1 January 2026</td>
<td width="200">New Year’s Day</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="200">Friday, 3 April 2026</td>
<td width="200">Good Friday</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="200">Monday, 6 April 2026</td>
<td width="200">Easter Monday</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="200">Friday, 1 May 2026</td>
<td width="200">Labour Day</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="200">Friday, 25 December 2026</td>
<td width="200">Christmas Day</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

</div>
