        <h4 class="related-document-title"><a href="/en/Document/law-of-3-july-2025/">Law of 3 July 2025 (only in French)</a></h4>
                  <p class="related-document-excerpt">amending 1° the Law of 5 April 1993 on the financial sector, as amended; 2° the Law of 11 January 2008 on transparency requirements for issuers, as amended; 3° the Law of 30 May 2018 on markets in financial instruments,&hellip;</p>
              </div>
