    <h3 class="library-item__title"><a href="/en/2025/04/the-cssf-publishes-in-accordance-with-article-134-of-the-law-of-30-may-2018-on-markets-in-financial-instruments-its-decision-to-request-the-suspension-from-trading-of-the-securities-issued-by-unipro/">The CSSF publishes in accordance with Article 13(4) of the Law of 30 May 2018 on markets in financial instruments its decision to request the suspension from trading of the securities issued by UNIPRO Capital a.s. (ISIN: SK4000023263)</a></h3>
